-- UNCONSTRAINED binding sharing the surface name `pick` with cmod's constrained one.
-- Its dict arity is 0. An explicitly-imported occurrence of it (wmod's) is the #739
-- arm of `inferDictAtFound`: the name is in the dict-name set because of cmod, so the
-- marker mints an `EDictAt` for it, but `declaredIds` is empty and the callee has a
-- known import definer, so the arm records NO goal and publishes the id as an explicit
-- empty entry (`EvMany []`). That is the one occurrence shape that needs no routing
-- yet still has an entry in the evidence table.
export pick : a -> a
pick x = x
